id: TEST-023
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Mocha without --forbid-pending
category: quality
severity: info
engine: absence
target:
  filenames: .mocharc.yml .mocharc.json .mocharc.js
  exclude_paths: .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: console.log
patterns:
  - regex: --forbid-pending|forbidPending
    message: "Mocha without --forbid-pending — skipped tests go unnoticed"
fix: Add --forbid-pending to mocha config to fail CI when tests are skipped. Forces team to fix or remove skipped tests.
